00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:58.980
Finalmente tenemos

00:09:58.980 --> 00:09:59.500
el requisito

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.660
de trazabilidad total de la FUN.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.600
En un entorno empresarial

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.260
de alto riesgo,

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:04.020
la IA lo dijo,

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:05.480
